{"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnannotationview\/initwithreuseidentifier:"]}],"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Instance Method","symbolKind":"method","title":"initWithReuseIdentifier:","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"- ","kind":"text"},{"text":"initWithReuseIdentifier:","kind":"identifier"}],"externalID":"c:objc(cs)MLNAnnotationView(im)initWithReuseIdentifier:","remoteSource":{"url":"https:\/\/github.com\/maplibre\/maplibre-native\/blob\/main\/platform\/ios\/src\/MLNAnnotationView.h#L77","fileName":"MLNAnnotationView.h"},"fragments":[{"kind":"text","text":"- "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"initWithReuseIdentifier:"}],"modules":[{"name":"MapLibre"}],"role":"symbol"},"kind":"symbol","identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNAnnotationView\/initWithReuseIdentifier:","interfaceLanguage":"occ"},"abstract":[{"text":"Initializes and returns a new annotation view object.","type":"text"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre","doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNAnnotationView"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["occ"],"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"],"tokens":[{"kind":"text","text":"- ("},{"kind":"keyword","text":"instancetype"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"initWithReuseIdentifier:"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"NSString","preciseIdentifier":"c:objc(cs)NSString"},{"kind":"text","text":" *) "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"reuseIdentifier"},{"kind":"text","text":";"}]}]},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"name":"reuseIdentifier","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A unique string identifier for this view that allows you","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"to reuse this view with multiple similar annotations. You can set this","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"parameter to ","type":"text"},{"code":"nil","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" if you don’t intend to reuse the view, but it is a good"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"idea in general to specify a reuse identifier to avoid creating redundant"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"views."}]}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"return-value","text":"Return Value","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The initialized annotation view object.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"text":"Discussion","type":"heading","anchor":"discussion","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The reuse identifier provides a way for you to improve performance by recycling"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"annotation views as they enter and leave the map’s viewport. As an annotation"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"leaves the viewport, the map view moves its associated view to a reuse queue."},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"When a new annotation becomes visible, you can request a view for that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"annotation by passing the appropriate reuse identifier string to the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMapView\/dequeueReusableAnnotationViewWithIdentifier:","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" method."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"references":{"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre":{"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"Powerful, free and open-source mapping toolkit with full control over data sources and styling.","type":"text"}],"role":"collection","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre","title":"MapLibre","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNAnnotationView":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNAnnotationView","role":"symbol","title":"MLNAnnotationView","fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MLNAnnotationView"}],"url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnannotationview","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"The ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNAnnotationView","type":"reference"},{"text":" class is responsible for marking a point annotation","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"with a view. Annotation views represent an annotation object, which is an","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"object that corresponds to the ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNAnnotation","type":"reference"},{"text":" protocol. When an annotation’s","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"geographic coordinate is visible in the map view, the map view asks its","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"delegate to a corresponding annotation view. If an annotation view is created","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"with a reuse identifier, the map view may recycle the view when it goes","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"offscreen.","type":"text"}]},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNAnnotationView/initWithReuseIdentifier:":{"title":"initWithReuseIdentifier:","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Initializes and returns a new annotation view object."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNAnnotationView\/initWithReuseIdentifier:","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnannotationview\/initwithreuseidentifier:","fragments":[{"text":"- ","kind":"text"},{"text":"initWithReuseIdentifier:","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","role":"symbol"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNAnnotation":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNAnnotation","role":"symbol","title":"MLNAnnotation","fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MLNAnnotation"}],"url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnannotation","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNAnnotation"},{"type":"text","text":" protocol is used to provide annotation-related information"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to a map view. To use this protocol, you adopt it in any custom objects that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"store or represent annotation data. Each object then serves as the source of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"information about a single map annotation and provides critical information,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"such as the annotation’s location on the map. Annotation objects do not provide"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the visual representation of the annotation but typically coordinate (in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"conjunction with the map view’s delegate) the creation of an appropriate"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"objects to handle the display."}]},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNMapView/dequeueReusableAnnotationViewWithIdentifier:":{"title":"dequeueReusableAnnotationViewWithIdentifier:","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Returns a reusable annotation view object associated with its identifier."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMapView\/dequeueReusableAnnotationViewWithIdentifier:","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnmapview\/dequeuereusableannotationviewwithidentifier:","fragments":[{"kind":"text","text":"- "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"dequeueReusableAnnotationViewWithIdentifier:"}],"type":"topic","role":"symbol"}}}